  "runtimeRules": [
    "Audio events are animation-driven, not fired from arbitrary timers.",
    "heavyHit and hurt fire on the exact visual impact frame.",
    "knockdownImpact fires when the losing sprite contacts the floor.",
    "K.O. fires only after body contact if the match ended.",
    "PERFECT fires after K.O. only when final match score is 2-0.",
    "On Round 3: finalRound -> short dramatic pause -> fight.",
    "Do not play K.O. after every round if the match is still alive.",
    "Round 1: announcer.round1 -> pause -> announcer.fight.",
    "Round 2: announcer.round2 -> pause -> announcer.fight.",
    "Round result while match continues: combat.mediumHit + fighter hurt + knockdownImpact; no K.O.",
    "Finishing result: combat.heavyHit + fighter hurt + knockdownImpact -> announcer.ko -> announcer.perfect only if 2-0 -> crowd.matchWin.",
    "UI cursor move variants must use random/no-immediate-repeat.",
    "Use ambience.coldRoom only on the Esperança refrigerated warehouse/loading-dock stage.",
    "Ambient loops must crossfade in runtime; do not hard-loop file end to file start."
  ],
